{"id":"vod_jy_49714","vodId":"49714","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"怪物 MONSTER","name_cn":"怪物 MONSTER","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第74集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/dfcc3a8e17d7c916a527f5e766f27359.jpg"},"summary":"供职于西德艾斯勒纪念医院的日本人天马贤三被人称作“天才医生”，他的外科技术精湛，为人谦和，受到同事的羡慕和医患的敬仰。事业上，天马前途一片光明，为院长所看好；爱情上，院长的女儿爱娃与之相恋，如胶似漆。然而看似一切美好的天马却渐渐感到良心上的不安，他亲眼目睹院方为抢救重要人物而置病危的普通人于不顾，死者家属的指责和哭泣让天马备受煎熬。当这种两难抉择再一次到来之时，天马毅然选择抢救一个头部中枪的男孩。他牺牲了自己的事业和爱情，却换来一个可怕怪物的复活。在接下来的岁月里，天马和怪物约翰展开了斗智斗勇的游戏，一段尘封的历史慢慢被揭开……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-07-01 20:30:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":74,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3xPg4a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg9NOZb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbW9Xr4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7e5zXvZa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dN6ygmd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xbogkBNb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axrwAzd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/oeEVmEma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xbogkoAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg9Nqlb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqkm4ke/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqkm4De/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7B2K8d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/kazwyjOb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRVDqzd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJ9rwvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbk0N4Kd/index.m3u8"